===Noun===
{{en-plural noun}}

# The [[military]] [[force]]s of a [[nation]], such as the [[army]], [[navy]], [[air force]], [[marine]]s and, sometimes, [[coastguard]] or [[border guard]], which are tasked with the defence of the nation and its [[citizen]]s, if necessary through use of deadly force.

